{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f00b9598-ac36-898f-9a1d-908d5b6a7ca5",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:10:52-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:03-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:06-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. This is Miguel Castillo. I'm calling about the trash pickup schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:12-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Castillo. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:16-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I heard there was a holiday week and the days got moved around. I'd like to know the new schedule. I'm at 369 Marsh Street, in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:26-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 369 Marsh. Let me pull that up. Are you asking about trash, recycling, or both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:32-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, if you've got it. I put the bin out Monday and it was still sitting there this morning, so I suspect I'm off by a day. [pause] Sorry, hold on, I'm wiping my glasses. I can't see the calendar on the fridge anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:47-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush. Okay, so on Marsh Street your pickup was pushed back a day that week because of the holiday. Trash goes out Wednesday this week, and recycling is the week after, also Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:59-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's tomorrow, then. Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:02-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow for trash, yes. Put it out the night before or early that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:08-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And is there a fee for that? Because of the late pickup. I wouldn't want a surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:15-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no fee for a shifted pickup. It's your regular service, just moved a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:21-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's about the only good news I've had this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:26-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll take it. After that it should go back to the normal schedule. If you want, the city site has the collection calendar you can print in big letters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:37-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have somebody look at it. Wednesday, then. Trash tomorrow, recycling next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:42-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:49-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Castillo. Take care."
    }
  ],
